OL,3,GNEWSAArtist 'starstruck' by Kenny
OL,4,ADalglish mural visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist has said he was "starstruck"
OL,7,Fto meet Sir Kenny Dalglish when he
OL,8,Fvisited Anfield to see a mural he had
OL,9,Fcreated of the former Liverpool FC
OL,10,Fplayer.
OL,12,FAnthony Donnelly was commissioned to do
OL,13,Fthe three-storey mural on the side of
OL,14,Fthe ARC Hotel on Anfield Road,
OL,15,FLiverpool, along with a second mural of
OL,16,FSir Kenny on Gertrude Road opposite.
OL,18,FHe said the project, which took 14
OL,19,Fdays, was "the opportunity of a
OL,20,Flifetime" and "I listened to You'll
OL,21,FNever Walk Alone quite a few times in
OL,22,Fthe car on the way over".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
