OL,3,GNEWSAArtist 'starstruck' by Kenny
OL,4,ADalglish mural visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said Sir Kenny, who signed the
OL,7,Fartwork, described the murals as
OL,8,F"tremendous", which he said was
OL,9,F"awesome to hear".
